AICore port of the upstream OpenPCDet-GGML fused BN-fold+ReLU op:
- ggml_bn_fold_relu: dst = relu(x * scale + bias), per-channel [1,1,C,1]
  scale/bias; CUDA float4 fast path + scalar stride fallback + CPU impl.
Replaces the mul+add+relu triple after every detector conv (~13ms/frame
on nuScenes CenterPoint). Only the OpenPCDet CUDA-ext graphs emit the node
(bev_backbone g_bn_fuse_relu); every other task graph is unchanged.
